  <Section variant="light" divider={false}>
    <div class="prose prose-light mx-auto max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> January 2026</p>
      <p>These Terms and Conditions govern your use of the Decision Engines website and services. By accessing our site, you agree to these terms.</p>
      <h2>Use of services</h2>
      <p>Decision Engines provides enterprise AI software and services subject to separate license agreements. Website content is for informational purposes only.</p>
      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>All content, trademarks, and technology on this site are owned by Decision Engines, Inc. or its licensors.</p>
      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Decision Engines shall not be liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of this website.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:info@decisionengines.ai">info@decisionengines.ai</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
